{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206200","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1120620001:0":{"text":"This place truly is beautiful, especially the sunset. We can't see anything like that in our hometown.","source_cn":"这里的风景可真壮美，尤其是落日时分。我们的家乡是见不到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9694B6A7BAEADDB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1120620002:0":{"text":"\"As the hunter gazed at the setting sun over the desert sand, his heart suddenly began to stir at everything so grand.\"","source_cn":"“猎手塞雷克看着荒漠的落日，心里突然涌起了一阵冲动”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1DA01F87B7F3D63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120620003:0":{"text":"\"He felt the urge to gallop, to outpace the scorching sun and return to the moment when the gunfire sounded done.\"","source_cn":"“他要策马奔驰，跑得比骄阳与黄沙更快，重新回到枪声刚刚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DD9DCC27DD8F17A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120620004:0":{"text":"There you go again, Evan...","source_cn":"艾文，你又开始了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05AC7792443D5241","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:宝藏猎人欧迪尔":{"text":"Hunter Oldiler","source":"宝藏猎人欧迪尔","st